flowchart LR
    %% External entities
    Visitor[Visitor]
    Reader[Reader / Book Friend]
    DeliveryPartner[Delivery Partner]
    Admin[Admin]
    MapAPIs[Map Services\nOSM + Nominatim + OSRM]

    %% Processes
    P1((P1 Authenticate User))
    P2((P2 Manage Profile))
    P3((P3 Manage Books and Offers))
    P4((P4 Process Exchange Requests))
    P5((P5 Manage Delivery Lifecycle))
    P6((P6 Handle Notifications))
    P7((P7 Admin Moderation))
    P8((P8 Render Route and Cost))

    %% Data stores
    D1[(D1 Users)]
    D2[(D2 Roles)]
    D3[(D3 Books)]
    D4[(D4 Offers)]
    D5[(D5 Offer Images Metadata)]
    D6[(D6 Exchange Requests)]
    D7[(D7 Delivery Offers)]
    D8[(D8 Notifications)]
    D9[(D9 Uploaded Offer Files)]

    Visitor -->|Register or Login request| P1
    Reader -->|Login credentials| P1
    DeliveryPartner -->|Login credentials| P1
    Admin -->|Admin login credentials| P1

    P1 -->|Find user by email| D1
    P1 -->|Resolve authorities| D2
    P1 -->|Session or JWT and role redirect| Reader
    P1 -->|Session or JWT and role redirect| DeliveryPartner
    P1 -->|Authenticated admin session| Admin

    Reader -->|Profile details + coordinates| P2
    P2 -->|Update profile| D1
    P2 -->|Profile update response| Reader

    Visitor -->|Browse catalog and offers| P3
    Reader -->|Create/Edit/Delete offer| P3
    P3 -->|Read books| D3
    P3 -->|Persist offers| D4
    P3 -->|Persist image URLs| D5
    P3 -->|Store uploaded images| D9
    P3 -->|Book/offer list response| Visitor
    P3 -->|Book/offer list response| Reader

    Reader -->|Send/Accept/Reject exchange request| P4
    P4 -->|Create/Update request| D6
    P4 -->|Reserve linked offers| D4
    P4 -->|Create delivery offer on acceptance| D7
    P4 -->|Exchange status response| Reader
    P4 -->|Publish exchange events| P6

    DeliveryPartner -->|Accept/Pickup/Complete delivery| P5
    P5 -->|Read exchange context| D6
    P5 -->|Update lifecycle status and timestamps| D7
    P5 -->|Delivery status response| DeliveryPartner
    P5 -->|Publish delivery events| P6

    Reader -->|Open map and route preview| P8
    DeliveryPartner -->|Open delivery route page| P8
    P8 -->|Read delivery distance/cost context| D7
    P8 -->|Route/geocoding requests| MapAPIs
    MapAPIs -->|Tiles/routes/addresses| P8
    P8 -->|Map + distance + cost response| Reader
    P8 -->|Map + distance + cost response| DeliveryPartner

    Reader -->|Fetch and mark notifications| P6
    DeliveryPartner -->|Fetch and mark notifications| P6
    Admin -->|Fetch and mark notifications| P6
    P6 -->|Persist notification events| D8
    P6 -->|Notification list/summary response| Reader
    P6 -->|Notification list/summary response| DeliveryPartner
    P6 -->|Notification list/summary response| Admin

    Admin -->|Manage books/users/offers/exchanges| P7
    P7 -->|Book CRUD| D3
    P7 -->|Block users| D1
    P7 -->|Block/Delete offers| D4
    P7 -->|Approve exchange requests| D6
    P7 -->|Generate delivery offer if needed| D7
    P7 -->|Publish admin-triggered events| P6
    P7 -->|Admin operation response| Admin
